# The license texts ship byte for byte as each package's wheel holds them, and
# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md quotes sha256 values for two of them. A Windows
# checkout converts LF to CRLF in text files, and that put CRLF into 38 of the
# 71 files under _internal/licenses/ in the Windows build of 2026-11-01 (Build
# Windows run 41265620753). `-text` turns the conversion off for these files
# only. tests/test_notices_ship.py asks git, per file, that it stays off.
licenses/** -text
